@host = http://localhost:5000

### Sign in as test Buyer (credentials: docs/local-dev.md)
# @name signIn
POST {{host}}/auth/sign-in
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "buyer-test@gdziekupic.local",
  "password": "Buyer123!"
}

###
### GOOD - valid coordinates (Krakow), expect 200
GET {{host}}/api/location?latitude=50.0614&longitude=19.9366
Authorization: Bearer {{signIn.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### GOOD - coordinates in ocean / no address, expect 404
GET {{host}}/api/location?latitude=0&longitude=0
Authorization: Bearer {{signIn.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### BAD - missing latitude, expect 400
GET {{host}}/api/location?longitude=19.9366
Authorization: Bearer {{signIn.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### BAD - missing longitude, expect 400
GET {{host}}/api/location?latitude=50.0614
Authorization: Bearer {{signIn.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### BAD - empty coordinates, expect 400
GET {{host}}/api/location?latitude=&longitude=
Authorization: Bearer {{signIn.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### BAD - non-numeric coordinates, expect 400 (validation gap candidate)
GET {{host}}/api/location?latitude=abc&longitude=xyz
Authorization: Bearer {{signIn.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### BAD - out-of-range latitude (>90), expect 400 (validation gap candidate)
GET {{host}}/api/location?latitude=123.45&longitude=19.9366
Authorization: Bearer {{signIn.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### BAD - out-of-range longitude (>180), expect 400 (validation gap candidate)
GET {{host}}/api/location?latitude=50.0614&longitude=555
Authorization: Bearer {{signIn.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### BAD - no token, expect 401
GET {{host}}/api/location?latitude=50.0614&longitude=19.9366

### BAD - invalid token, expect 401
GET {{host}}/api/location?latitude=50.0614&longitude=19.9366
Authorization: Bearer not-a-valid-jwt

